sequenceDiagram
  actor Family as 家属端
  participant API as NestJS
  participant MySQL
  participant Redis
  participant Device as 陪伴设备
  participant LiveKit

  Family->>API: 创建 Remote Assistance Session
  API->>API: 校验 Member/Care Authority/Policy/Consent
  API->>Redis: SET NX media-owner:{bindingId}
  Redis-->>API: 租约成功
  API-->>Device: remote-session.invited
  Device->>Device: 响铃或预授权倒计时
  Device->>API: accept / decline
  API-->>Family: remote-session.accepted
  Family->>API: 请求短时 Join Ticket
  API->>MySQL: 锁会话并提交唯一 PROVISIONING owner
  API->>LiveKit: owner 在事务外显式 CreateRoom
  API->>MySQL: 新事务提交 room_provisioned_at + ROOM_READY
  API-->>Family: 家属 LiveKit Token
  Device->>API: 请求短时 Join Ticket
  API->>MySQL: 读取已提交的 room_provisioned_at
  API-->>Device: 设备 LiveKit Token
  Family->>LiveKit: 加入房间
  Device->>Device: MediaSessionCoordinator 释放 MiniCPM-o
  Device->>LiveKit: 加入并发布摄像头/麦克风
  LiveKit->>API: Webhook: 双方加入及轨道发布
  API-->>Family: session ACTIVE
  Family->>API: 结束会话
  API->>LiveKit: 移除参与者/删除房间
  API->>Redis: 释放媒体租约
  API-->>Device: remote-session.ended
  Device->>Device: 释放媒体；提示是否恢复 AI 陪伴
